# Section 2 — Non-Functional Requirements

| # | Quality Attribute | Requirement | Measurement Method | Metric | Threshold |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| **NFR1** | Performance | The system shall compute risk scores and evaluate return claims within the latency target. | Measure end-to-end processing time on a test set of 20 return claims. | p90 latency | < 3,000 ms |
| **NFR2** | Correctness | Evaluation decisions and policy citations shall match ground-truth Shopee policy rules. | Evaluate test scenarios using a policy compliance rubric. | Correct response rate (%) | ≥ 85% |
| **NFR3** | Reliability | The background evaluation service shall maintain operational availability during peak hours. | Record API endpoint uptime over evaluation runs. | System Uptime (%) | ≥ 99.5% |
| **NFR4** | Maintainability | Updates to official Shopee policy documents shall be indexed without changing application code. | Run a controlled document update test with new policy markdown files. | Update re-indexing time | < 10 min |

